{"title":"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of this figure is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/4/5c4dad77fbcdaccfa76aa2b1122b853b6b5e0abc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\text{ cm}^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" />.  Its perimeter is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/8/4b8e9c1dd2a6fd8adac856d778af57eb39bc2aa3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,2)--(2,2)--(2,1)--(3,1)--(3,0)--(1,0)--(1,1)--(0,1)--cycle,linewidth(1)); draw((1,2)--(1,1)--(2,1)--(2,0),dashed); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"168\" />\n</p>\n<center>[figure consists of four identical squares]</center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/c/b4cf6106ef254433b17e9427be06763a4f40c57a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\text{20 cm} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\text{25 cm} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\text{30 cm} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\text{40 cm} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{50 cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"502\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the area of the whole figure is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/4/5c4dad77fbcdaccfa76aa2b1122b853b6b5e0abc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\text{ cm}^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" />, each square has an area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/a/00aa4829698003134a6c87be3b1ed1e593b45950.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100}{4} = 25\\text{ cm}^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" /> and a side length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/d/07d4ea07003d71593be34babf8a64286d0cfffdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{25} = 5\\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"21\" />.  \n</p><p>The boundary of this figure is made of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> segments, each of length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/f/8ff95353932d7e0b93b955e3c8982afde7b045cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, so it perimeter is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/e/e6e52675576b622fc71ebf0d3864e7f26771424d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\cdot 5=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 50\\text{ cm}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"156\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME\" title=\"1990 AJHSME\">1990 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1990 AJ